{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22177","headline":"咏慵 · 白居易","name":"咏慵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有官慵不选，有田慵不农。\n屋穿慵不葺，衣裂慵不缝。\n有酒慵不酌，无异尊常空。\n有琴慵不弹，亦与无弦同。\n家人告饭尽，欲炊慵不舂。\n亲朋寄书至，欲读慵开封。\n尝闻嵇叔夜，一生在慵中。\n弹琴复锻铁，比我未爲慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}